  "body": "SET DATE SALE: CLOSES 4.00PM, 02 DECEMBER (UNLESS SOLD PRIOR)\r\n\r\nWake up to peaceful panoramic sea views and experience a lifestyle where every day feels like a holiday. Positioned in the prestigious Macleans zone of Bucklands Beach, this near-new coastal residence delivers the perfect balance of grand family living, refined elegance and relaxed waterfront charm. Designed to maximise its stunning panoramic sea views, this impressive three-level home combines timeless style with modern comfort, creating a warm and welcoming sanctuary for families of all ages.\r\n\r\nBuilt only 2 years ago with exceptional attention to detail, the home offers a sense of sophistication from the moment you arrive. High-quality finishes, underfloor heating, heat pumps and double internal access garaging provide everyday comfort and convenience, while the thoughtfully designed layout ensures there is space for both family connection and private retreat. Every corner of the property has been carefully planned and beautifully presented to enhance both functionality and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOn the main living level, the home immediately impresses with its soaring 3.2m stud ceiling and light-filled interiors. Expansive open-plan living and dining spaces flow effortlessly to a glass-framed balcony where sweeping sea views and unforgettable sunsets become part of daily life. The elegant designer kitchen sits at the heart of the home, complete with premium appliances, sleek finishes and generous space for entertaining family and friends. A separate lounge offers additional flexibility for relaxed evenings or quiet gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe lower level provides a wonderful private haven for extended family, teenagers, or guests. Two spacious waterfront bedrooms open directly to a large sun-soaked deck, creating the perfect place to unwind while enjoying the sparkling outlook and evening sunsets. A beautifully finished ensuite, along with a separate lounge or media room, completes this level and adds further comfort and independence.\r\nOccupying the upper floor is the luxurious master retreat, where elevated sea views create a truly peaceful atmosphere. Complete with a walk-in wardrobe and a spacious ensuite, this is a space designed for relaxation. Two further generously proportioned bedrooms, a stylish family bathroom and an additional living area ensures every member of the family has room to spread out and enjoy.\r\n\r\nSet within one of East Auckland's most sought-after seaside communities, the location perfectly complements the home's exceptional lifestyle appeal. Zoned for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College and only moments from Half Moon Bay Marina, ferry services, waterfront cafes and beautiful beaches, this is a rare opportunity to secure a modern coastal family home where elegance, space and sea views come together effortlessly.\r\n\r\n*Find more properties you may like at https://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
